{"seq":1,"slug":"literary-theory-grad","title":"文学理论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"文学理论-简介\">文学理论 简介</h1><p>文学理论是文学研究的方法论根基，为理解和解释文学文本提供了多元的分析框架。研究生阶段的文学理论学习不再停留于流派知识的梳理，而是深入追问文学何以成为文学、文本意义如何生成与传播、以及批评实践怎样回应不同历史语境的挑战。</p>\n<p>本课程涵盖四个核心章节。第一章<strong>经典文学理论</strong>从形式主义、结构主义出发，经由马克思主义文学批评到精神分析批评，帮助学习者建立对二十世纪文学理论主要传统的系统理解。第二章<strong>后结构主义与解构</strong>聚焦于对结构主义的反思与超越，探讨解构主义、互文性理论和读者反应理论如何重新界定文本、作者与读者之间的关系。第三章<strong>文化研究路径</strong>将文学批评置于更广阔的社会文化场域，涉及后殖民批评、女性主义文学理论和酷儿理论等议题，揭示文学与权力、身份、差异之间的深层关联。第四章<strong>数字人文与文学研究</strong>面向当代技术转型，介绍远距离阅读、计算文学研究和数字档案等新兴方法，展示数字工具如何为文学研究带来全新的认识论可能。</p>\n<p>学习者可按章节顺序推进，先扎牢经典理论基础，再逐步进入后结构主义和文化研究的复杂论域，最终了解数字人文的前沿实践。在阅读过程中，建议结合具体文学文本进行理论应用练习，并注意不同理论范式之间的对话与张力——理论的价值不仅在于提供答案，更在于帮助我们提出更深刻的问题。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-theories","title":"经典文学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/classical-theories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"formalism-structuralism","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 形式主义与结构主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/classical-theories/formalism-structuralism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"marxist-criticism","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 马克思主义文学批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/classical-theories/marxist-criticism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"psychoanalytic-criticism","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 精神分析批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/classical-theories/psychoanalytic-criticism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"post-structuralism","title":"后结构主义与解构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/post-structuralism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deconstruction","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 解构主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/post-structuralism/deconstruction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"intertextuality","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 互文性理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/post-structuralism/intertextuality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reader-response-theory","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 读者反应理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/post-structuralism/reader-response-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cultural-studies","title":"文化研究路径","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/cultural-studies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"postcolonial-criticism","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 后殖民批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/cultural-studies/postcolonial-criticism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feminist-literary-theory","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 女性主义文学理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/cultural-studies/feminist-literary-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"queer-theory-literature","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 酷儿理论与文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/cultural-studies/queer-theory-literature"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-humanities","title":"数字人文与文学研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/digital-humanities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distant-reading","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 远距离阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/digital-humanities/distant-reading"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computational-literary-studies","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 计算文学研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/digital-humanities/computational-literary-studies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-archives","title":"研究生 文学理论 — 数字档案与文学遗产","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/literary-theory-grad/digital-humanities/digital-archives"}]}]}